      "date": "2026-11-02",
      "notes": "Build (experimental): a new Build tab builds your game with any build profile (Unity 6 profiles or classic platforms), edits profiles (scenes, scripting defines, development build, platform settings; create, copy, rename, delete, activate), shows live progress and results (size, what takes the space, log, history), and answers Unity's questions before and during a build with the choices you set in Automatic answers. Turn it on per project in Overview › Tools in this project. Builds run in a background Unity when Unity is closed. Coming soon: install an APK on your phone through Unity Tools Connect. 한국어: the app now speaks Korean as well as English (Settings › General › Language). Menus, notifications and the app's screens are translated; the Agent chat panel and the Edit designer stay in English for now. Bundles Unity Build Tools' Unity package 0.1.0; other Unity packages unchanged.",
